WEBVTT

00:34:57.954 --> 00:35:03.954
I was at a good age to get it because
I had some years left in my career

00:35:03.954 --> 00:35:10.329
and it made many things much easier
having a Nobel and it made

00:35:11.871 --> 00:35:15.121
the end of my career more productive,
I think,

00:35:15.371 --> 00:35:19.704
and and happier than it would
have been otherwise.

00:35:27.038 --> 00:35:29.454
Taken for granted as part of
the TED Audio Collective,

00:35:29.954 --> 00:35:32.954
the show is hosted by Adam Grant
and it's produced by TED with